"1\">′</mo></msup><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mi>v</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, we calculate the integral, as follows:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"136\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 24.403em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\